{"errno":0,"msg":"","data":[{"id":2492814,"ctime":1790274888,"title":"谷歌TPU，下周出发去太空","brief":"①谷歌计划下周发射搭载4颗TPU的原型卫星，验证AI芯片在太空中的耐辐射能力与散热表现；\n②公司计划2027年进一步测试双星激光互联，规模化应用仍需多年探索。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260925/Z09hv478a1_1000x617.png","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492814,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"史正丞","reading_num":4304,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492812,"ctime":1790273389,"title":"纽约州起诉预测市场平台Polymarket 指控其无证经营赌博业务","brief":"①纽约州政府周四对预测市场平台Polymarket提起诉讼，指控其在未取得许可的情况下经营赌博业务；\n②诉讼要求对该公司处以罚款，并责令其向用户支付赔偿，纽约州政府认为，预测市场符合赌博的法律定义。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG31N2288976914_4b49486f897c441dbc64806a03f55e3d_1790273085.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492812,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"牛占林","reading_num":6005,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492801,"ctime":1790268990,"title":"谷歌、OpenAI、Anthropic据称拟共建“前沿AI标准局”","brief":"①据媒体援引知情人士消息，谷歌、OpenAI与Anthropic正推进组建一家AI安全标准机构，暂定名为\"前沿AI标准局\"（SAFA），计划在没有政府监管的情况下独立运作，目标于今年年底或2027年初落地；\n②此前，美国联邦层面的AI监管进展迟缓，相关机构的筹建也陷入停滞。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260925/w3Ki5ijmwO_400x267.jpg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492801,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"李莹","reading_num":7879,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492766,"ctime":1790267354,"title":"美联储保尔森释放进一步加息信号：通胀回落仍不理想 年内紧缩预期升温","brief":"①费城联储主席保尔森表示，若经济走势符合预期，美联储可能需要进一步加息，以推动通胀回归2%的目标水平；\n②她指出，即使剔除美伊战争引发的石油供应冲击以及关税带来的影响，通胀仍维持在偏高水平。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG111667501761_cfeef5f61df3491e80cd44e2f054b222_1790265108.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492766,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"牛占林","reading_num":12180,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492703,"ctime":1790258733,"title":"甲骨文重磅项目现风险信号：据称正为数据中心延期留后路","brief":"①知情人士透露，甲骨文已向Stack Infrastructure发出援引“不可抗力”条款的通知，寻求在“木星计划”延迟交付的情况下推迟相关付款义务；\n②这座设计容量达到2.45吉瓦的数据中心园区已经遭遇严重阻碍，面临的困难包括一项对能源资源规划至关重要的许可证申请遭到拒绝。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG111660706690_dddc9af4c5744ab4840f363f56acd047_1790257848.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492703,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"赵昊","reading_num":104265,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492724,"ctime":1790262076,"title":"德国加速能源转型 拟于2045年前逐步淘汰化石燃料","brief":"①德国政府公布的一份路线图首次明确提出，到2045年退出化石燃料；\n②德国计划到2030年将可再生能源发电量占比从目前的55%提高至80%；\n③德国重申了此前提出的目标，即未来十年逐步减少煤炭使用，并计划在2038年退出煤炭。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG111659650818_6445f0f4d36a45f0b03bb3952cb4ff66_1790260152.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492724,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"牛占林","reading_num":136446,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492534,"ctime":1790247318,"title":"4家银行被罚，相关违法行为披露","brief":"①江苏银行因13项违法违规行为被罚款937.1万元； \n②中国邮政储蓄银行因十项违法违规行为被罚款1743.3万元；\n③渤海银行被罚没542.88万元，广发银行合计罚没约1714万元。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/gKrIfXHOs1_1000x667.jpg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492534,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"财联社","reading_num":149201,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492718,"ctime":1790259760,"title":"美债收益率升至逾20年高位 摩根大通策略师仍看好股票","brief":"①摩根大通策略师预计企业盈利增长将进一步扩散，2027年盈利预期仍有望兑现甚至上调，建议关注具备定价权和盈利可见度的公司；\n②美银指出美国政府净利息支出已升至GDP的3.3%，更高无风险收益率正加大估值压力和股市调整风险。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/2AZV6ZG7t4_1024x683.jpg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492718,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"夏军雄","reading_num":103970,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492728,"ctime":1790261080,"title":"多地证监局一天开出25张罚单，让网页都卡了","brief":"①罚单密集披露，数量至少25张，7家券商及多家期货、投顾公司、个人、私募被点名；\n②国盛证券、湘财证券账户实名制违规立案调查结果出炉；\n③有券商是年内首罚，有罚单是对券商前期违规事项的再追责，分支机构与营业部一级，岗位职责分离、经纪人管理、投资者适当性等前端环节反复出现违规问题。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/W8RE737Q9F_736x574.png","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492728,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"林坚","reading_num":103665,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492696,"ctime":1790260826,"title":"安琪酵母拟发行可转债募资不超过35亿元  布局酵母蛋白产能扩张 |速读公告","brief":"①安琪酵母拟向不特定对象发行可转债募资不超过35亿元，主要投向酵母蛋白产能建设及技术攻关项目；\n②公司目前酵母蛋白产能约1.6万吨，处于满产满销状态。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/9316vaz671_400x267.jpg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492696,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"吴蔚玲","reading_num":82158,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492451,"ctime":1790243019,"title":"美联储“三号人物”：年内或有必要再次加息 以抑制通胀","brief":"①纽约联储行长威廉姆斯表示，美联储可能需要在年内再次加息以缓解通胀风险；\n②市场预测美联储年底前再加息至少一次的概率已经超过九成；\n③威廉姆斯认为通胀问题仍然是一项挑战，需要及时将通胀拉回目标水平。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG41N1456875542_91ae384baf0a412ba599d3f7e271eb70_1790242704.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492451,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"刘蕊","reading_num":188687,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492627,"ctime":1790254228,"title":"债券ETF迈入万亿时代，37只百亿级花落谁家？谁在第一梯队？","brief":"①债券ETF规模首破万亿，达10022亿元，年内增20.9%；\n②海富通、博时稳居千亿梯队，易方达、平安等排名上升；\n③公司债、信用债ETF成吸金主力，科创债ETF内部分化明显。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/7Clefe5tnD_1000x667.jpg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492627,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"周晓雅","reading_num":122229,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492592,"ctime":1790252540,"title":"海外光刻胶巨头即将涨价，影响几何？多家国内产业链企业回应","brief":"①彤程新材表示，一个明显变化是，近期本土替代速度明显加快，下游晶圆厂给到的测试机会大幅增加，基础验证周期由此前的1-2年普遍缩短至6-12个月；\n②鼎龙股份方面表示，当前国内光刻胶整体国产化率仍处于低位，公司现阶段的核心目标是全力推动高端光刻胶产品实现稳定量产。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG41N1302266588_d978de50cb5041c9ae6ec084b2e82d94_1790252165.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492592,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"吴旭光","reading_num":165457,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492582,"ctime":1790251390,"title":"厦门钨业就豫鹭矿业钨生产事宜提起仲裁 洛阳钼业回应","brief":"①2001年，公司与厦门钨业签署有关豫鹭矿业的合资合同，并未对钨开采配额总量控制指标有过明确的约定。\n②7月1日，厦门钨业就此事发布公告，迅速形成舆论热点。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/kmXMvVkd00_800x531.jpg","level":"","article_tag":null,"source":"财联社","reading_num":126517,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492264,"ctime":1790236390,"title":"商务部：中美第八轮经贸磋商达成多项共识","brief":"","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/2uC1S53KL9_800x533.jpg","level":"","article_tag":null,"source":"财联社","reading_num":278325,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492604,"ctime":1790253701,"title":"大摩分析师：若美国禁柴油出口 汽油价格反而要涨","brief":"①摩根士丹利分析师表示，如果特朗普政府禁止美国出口柴油，美国司机应做好汽油价格上涨的准备；\n②即使炼油商在较低开工率下调整生产结构、尽可能提高汽油产出，美国汽油供应仍将减少约65万桶/日。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG31N2296241063_7693da95090e4ef08ed7b4bd63dfa21a_1790252945.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492604,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"赵昊","reading_num":97229,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492540,"ctime":1790247885,"title":"中国黄金进口，创历史新高","brief":"①中国今年前8个月在黄金上支出了1588亿美元，进口黄金逾1000吨；\n②今年7月中国持有的美国国债降至6180亿美元，为18年来的最低水平；\n③世界黄金协会的数据显示，中国去年的黄金产量达384吨。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/img/vcg/VCG41N1361658612_d5cd0d59a2aa42b89cff3ed154301052_1790247490.jpeg","level":"","article_tag":null,"source":"参考消息","reading_num":136310,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492573,"ctime":1790250085,"title":"涉嫌职务侵占、挪用资金 三安光电实控人留置半年后被刑拘","brief":"①时隔半年，三安光电实控人涉案一事迎来关键进展：林秀成已由留置转为刑事拘留；\n②林秀成其所涉嫌的事项亦首次披露，包括涉嫌职务侵占、挪用资金罪。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/6X486982Uz_1024x652.jpg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492573,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"方彦博","reading_num":141053,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492550,"ctime":1790249566,"title":"双帅印，一新局：由杨的“算法”——从破解历史包袱到重构产业棋局","brief":"9月24日，方正科技发布公告。由杨当选董事长。这是他卸任珠海科技产业集团董事长后的最新一站。而就在今年7月1日，他刚刚执掌长园集团。短短数月，两度挂帅。从上海调任珠海，一位“外来者”，凭什么频频破题？","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/490M827epS_1361x798.png","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":45,"articleID":2492550,"name":"资讯","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":17}],"source":"","reading_num":146670,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492544,"ctime":1790248112,"title":"一场“不动手不动嘴”的比赛，正在检验脑机接口能否走进生活","brief":"①首个聚焦脑机接口与医保创新场景的国家级赛事，指向“临床适配性、场景实用性、群众可及性”；\n②专家认为当前技术还无法支持精细操作，距离成熟稳定还需要5到10年；\n③产业沿非侵入式/侵入式、消费级/医疗极场景分化，支付方、商业节奏、投资逻辑各不同。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/HVY34MTJxX_1000x583.jpg","level":"","article_tag":[{"id":8,"articleID":2492544,"name":"原创","color":"#DE0723","visible":1,"categoryId":15}],"source":"武超","reading_num":238940,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492530,"ctime":1790246368,"title":"菲律宾爆发燃油危机","brief":"①菲律宾政府已与包括俄罗斯、澳大利亚和中国在内的“几乎所有国家”进行接洽，以确保菲律宾拥有充足的石油供应； \n②菲律宾目前仍有可供54天使用的石油供应。","image":"https://image.cls.cn/images/20260924/h5EkDr1vAT_2500x1667.jpg","level":"","article_tag":null,"source":"中国侨网","reading_num":248284,"external_link":"","is_ad":0,"audio_url":"","ad":{"id":0,"title":"","img":"","url":"","monitorUrl":"","video_url":"","adTag":"","fullScreen":0,"type":0},"ex_type":1,"c_type":0,"SortScore":0,"subjectStib":{"id":0,"name":"","img":"","is_reporter_subject":false}},{"id":2492436,"ctime":1790242293,"title":"独家丨监管明确险资港股通ETF投资口径，南向“长钱活水”可期","brief":"①可投资港股通股票的保险机构可以投资港股通ETF；\n②参照保险资金投资港股通股票的相关监管规定执行；\n③港股通ETF丰富险资境外配置工具箱，缓解行业QDII额度瓶颈。","image":"https://image.